test Emacs configuration for C++ development (eglot, clangd, compilation). Source Code Browse the full source on GitHub: cc-project on GitHub Files main.cpp - Entry point CMakeLists.txt - CMake build configuration MODULE.bazel - Bazel module definition BUILD - Bazel build file compile_commands.json - Compilation database for clangd Author: Franzelin Fabian (XC-AS/EMW2) Email: frf2lr@FEWI-C-0007J Created: 2026-05-28 Thu 16:23"},"examples/org-project/README.html":{"title":"Org example","url":"examples/org-project/README.html","snippet":"Org example Here comes an example on how to write academic papers with org-mode. This is a helpful guide called orgpapers . And here is another one. A...","content":"Org example Here comes an example on how to write academic papers with org-mode. This is a helpful guide called orgpapers . And here is another one. Author: Fabian Franzelin Email: fabian.franzelin@gmail.com Created: 2026-05-28 Thu 16:23"},"examples/python-project/README.html":{"title":"Simple Python Project","url":"examples/python-project/README.html","snippet":"Simple Python Project This is a minimal Python project to test Emacs configuration for Python development (eglot, pyright, pytest). Source Code Browse...","content":"Simple Python Project This is a minimal Python project to test Emacs configuration for Python development (eglot, pyright, pytest). Source Code Browse the full source on GitHub: python-project on GitHub Files __main__.py - Entry point pyproject.toml - Project configuration test_example.py - Example test file Author: Franzelin Fabian (XC-AS/EMW2) Email: frf2lr@FEWI-C-0007J Created: 2026-05-28 Thu 16:23"},"examples/ts-project/README.html":{"title":"TypeScript Project (tree-sitter + eglot)","url":"examples/ts-project/README.html","snippet":"TypeScript Project (tree-sitter + eglot) This is a minimal TypeScript project to test Emacs configuration for TypeScript development (tree-sitter, egl...","content":"TypeScript Project (tree-sitter + eglot) This is a minimal TypeScript project to test Emacs configuration for TypeScript development (tree-sitter, eglot, typescript-language-server). Source Code Browse the full source on GitHub: ts-project on GitHub Files src/main.ts - Entry point tsconfig.json - TypeScript configuration package.json - Node.js package configuration Author: Franzelin Fabian (XC-AS/EMW2) Email: frf2lr@FEWI-C-0007J Created: 2026-05-28 Thu 16:23"},"index.html":{"title":"dotfiles","url":"index.html","snippet":"dotfiles System Configuration In this repository, I gather my system configurations that allow me to have a consistent computing experience over multi...","content":"dotfiles System Configuration In this repository, I gather my system configurations that allow me to have a consistent computing experience over multiple Linux machines. It configures three main tools: GNU Emacs , ZSH , and Qtile . I use GNU Stow to install my configuration files on my Linux distributions. Everything can be rolled out by calling the main configure script of the repository ./configure -i Beyond Configurations Examples: Python, C++, org, Typescript/React WSL setup Author: Fabian Franzelin Email: fabian.franzelin@gmail.com Created: 2026-05-28 Thu 16:23"},"themes/simple_menu.html":{"title":"","url":"themes/simple_menu.html","snippet":"Home ☰","content":"Home ☰"},"wsl.html":{"title":"&lrm;","url":"wsl.html","snippet":"WSL2 Enable WSL2 Setup windows terminal Remove WSL completely Vcxsrv XLaunch setup for vcxsrv Configure X server I found the best way to use the vcxsr...","content":"WSL2 Enable WSL2 Setup windows terminal Remove WSL completely Vcxsrv XLaunch setup for vcxsrv Configure X server I found the best way to use the vcxsrv is to use the multi-window mode. Each GUI starts in its own window, it can be resized on-the-fly and they do not interfere with one another in the same window. Use the following command to start vcxsrv in that mode \"C:\\Program Files\\VcXsrv\\vcxsrv.exe\" :0 -clipboard -ac -multiwindow -wgl :0 Display number clipboard Enable clipboard sharing between host and wsl ac Disable access control restrictions so that the wsl client can connect to the server wgl Enable GLX extension For details, check the command line options of vcxsrv . Author: Franzelin Fabian (XC-AS/EMW2) Email: frf2lr@FEWI-C-0007J Created: 2026-05-28 Thu 16:23"}}}